//! `pipeline-unsupported` puts a pipe between shell commands.
//!
//! A shell block runs one command per statement.
//! The lowering refuses shell blocks before it reaches this form.
//!
//! The source pipes `printf 'x'` to `cat`.
//!
//! - see: #1057 — `piped`

/// `piped` puts a pipe between two commands.
@[refuses("OutOfFragment.shell_block")]
def piped() -> Unit { #!{ printf 'x' | cat; } }
